// Song folder. session.json is desk travel, clips, notes, and cords.
// The song owns patches/<name>.fxp. A VST chunk is patches/<id>.bin.
// host_seq is the last instance id issued. Packs stay paths.
// No audio is started.
//
// Copyright © 2026 Sean Collins, 2 Paws Machine and Engineering. SCSL v1.0.

